  "prompt": "A conceptual blueprint sketch of a Chinese-style wooden folding screen (pingfeng) as a background wall, shown from a dramatic wide-angle perspective for a stunning visual effect. The main 3D-rendered screen is set on a pure white background, featuring Jiangnan architectural motifs: finely carved rosewood lattice panels, moon gate patterns, ink-wash landscape inserts, delicate mother-of-pearl inlay, and flowing calligraphy plaques. Surrounding the main rendering are hand-drawn exploded views of structural joints, panel details, decorative patterns, and traditional mortise and tenon connections, each with precise annotations and measurements in English and Chinese. Clean technical pen outlines, visible pencil sketch marks, subtle ink wash shading, and layered presentation evoke both engineering clarity and artistic Chinese elegance. --ar 3:4 --raw --profile peo7f2q",
